TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-2605.19310v1
AU  - THEOREM, ROTH’S
TI  - A Fourier-Free Density-Increment Proof of Roth's Theorem
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.19310
AB  - We give an elementary, Fourier-free proof of Roth’s theorem. The proof follows Roth’s original density-increment strategy, but replaces the usual Fourier-analytic step with a direct combinatorial argument involving averages over sub-progressions.
ER  - 
